  "name": "Bienes y Servicios sujetos a Detracción (SPOT)",
  "source": "Anexos 2 y 3 del SPOT, catálogo 54, from resources/AnexosIyII_Formato1.3.4.xlsx (34 códigos) — NOT from perunio-frontend/src/data/sunat/detracciones.ts, which disagreed with it systematically. That file's descripciones were shifted across códigos (its 036 is this 031, its 041 is this 036, its 039 is this 040), it carried a código 041 the anexo does not define, it omitted 028 entirely even though the pipeline pins that one to Cat.51 1003, and several rates were the pre-2023 12% where the anexo says 10%. props.porcentaje is null for the six códigos whose Tasa % the anexo leaves blank (002, 011, 013, 015, 016, 028); those carry no `emit` or `select`, because offering a detracción without knowing its rate would guess at money withheld from a supplier. Fill the rate and add the capabilities together. props.umbral is the importe de la operación above which the detracción applies: S/700 by default, S/400 for transporte de carga (027) and none for the primera venta de inmuebles (040). **The umbral is measured against the operación, not against each comprobante** (Informe 103-2013-SUNAT) — that logic stays in resolveDetraccion; only the numbers live here. props.operationType is the Cat.51 código the operación must declare; any other pairing for the three pinned códigos is fault 3129.",
  "codePattern": "^[0-9]{3}$",
  "propRefs": {
    "operationType": "cat51"
  },
